// 旧 JS 语义：每次单目标【杀】/【决斗】均观看目标手牌，按方片数摸牌或增加本牌基础伤害；杀人后改按红色数。
skill twfengpo(4055936832) {
trigger card_targeted owner_source_sha_or_juedou_single_target_hand_nonempty {
    effect reveal_hand_to_player(event_player, self);
    if skill_content_flag(self, 4055936832, 0) == 0 {
      let count = hand_suit_count(event_player, diamond);
      if 0 < count {
        let option = choose(1, 2);
        if option == 1 {
          effect draw_cards(self, count);
        }
        if option == 2 {
          effect increase_current_card_base_damage(self, event_card, count);
        }
      }
    }
    if 0 < skill_content_flag(self, 4055936832, 0) {
      let count = hand_color_count(event_player, red);
      if 0 < count {
        let option = choose(1, 2);
        if option == 1 {
          effect draw_cards(self, count);
        }
        if option == 2 {
          effect increase_current_card_base_damage(self, event_card, count);
        }
      }
    }
  }

  trigger death owner_is_source {
    if skill_content_flag(self, 4055936832, 0) == 0 {
      effect set_skill_content_flag(self, 0, 1);
    }
  }
}